{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"(If I feel like it is not something I want to play, I will stop playing it. I don't really want to play a torture victim tonight.)","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:05:25.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868735675019710464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I'd prefer a spit sample, but a nick will do. I'll collect the blood drops from the floor.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:06:29.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868735945489395723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Up to you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:06:43.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868736004394201129","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I know what those things can do, and you don't have the right. Those are for watching people or controlling them or with blood, even summoning devils. What makes you think I want you to do any of that to me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:08:19.841000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-25T06:08:37.620000Z","id":"868736407294849035","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I very much presume you don't. But we have to keep a record of those who've made open threats against lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:09:06.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868736603433107486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I could be dead next week, or tomorrow for all I know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:09:23.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868736676321710131","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Says who? Who says you get to have my blood for any damn reason? Who died and left you in charge anyways?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:10:49.939000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868737036851494992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I feel like you should know very well who left us in charge. We were going to pay you 500 gold for that information, before things got out of hand.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:11:41.742000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868737254129025045","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I wasn't the asshole breaking shit.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:12:00.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868737333523001364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Like I said, we had sticks and we had carrots. Truth be told, I'm not extremely happy with how things turned out, but I expected a little more respect from a smuggler to law enforcement.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:13:29.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868737707566833694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I lost my temper. I'd apologize, but I think we're past certain niceties.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:14:31.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868737965327781888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Your boss didn't seem like no law enforcement. Buchanan never treated me like this ever. You come in, breaking shit, threatening me, you are the one fucking up the order of things. Aren't lamplighters supposed to be the rear fucking guard? What the hell were you doing in The City anyways? And you are right. We are past niceties. I don't owe you jack shit. Anything you take from me you are stealing. And last time I checked, you goody two shoes types weren't supposed to kidnap, steal and destroy property.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:16:09.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868738378391253002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"We run things a little differently than Buchanan did. And that's going to mean trouble for you, most likely. You don't seem interested in resolving the situation, so I think the only thing left to do is to collect the sample. \"","created_at":"2021-07-25T06:20:34.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868739489252642836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
